<title>CANADA: BCE buys 80,000 more Nortel shares.</title>
<headline>BCE buys 80,000 more Nortel shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCE Inc said on Monday that it acquired an additional 80,000 common shares of Northern Telecom Ltd.</p>
<p>After the transaction, BCE held 132,543,623 common shares of Northern Telecom or about 51.2 percent of the shares outstanding.</p>
<p>BCE said it may make other purchases of Northern Telecom shares in order to maintain its majority ownership level.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
